<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>Wright Homes — Estimated Monthly Payment Comparison</title>
<meta name="description" content="Wright Homes builder-prepared estimate of monthly housing payments for up to three floor plans. Not a loan quote or approval." />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0066A4" />
<style>
